  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I want to play MIDI music from UDON, but I can't.\n\nWe have callbacks for some stuff in MIDI. But we don't have one to handle an instrument change request. This means it's impossible for a MIDI file or external device to tell us which instruments to change to while playing. Tracks in a MIDI file can change instruments at any point, so hard-coding instruments ahead of time is insufficient.\n\nCurrently we have: MidiNoteOn, MidiNoteOff, MidiControlChange.\n\nWe need to get: MidiProgramChange.\n\nIf we had a hook for the MidiProgramChange event, I'd be able to handle instrument change requests coming from within the MIDI file. Then I could implement my own way of playing back MIDI files as audio.",
